exact toy chain ascent; DS3 kill direction; DS4a–c Tougeron/Newton
demo + failure control; DS5a–c data consistency (`D* >= 23`
forced); DS6a–b e-recipe + ctl0 control; DS7 DS-OB1 record. No git
commit.

