19:## 2. Version history v1→v5
20:- v1 2024-10-09, 25 pp. v2 2024-10-14 "minor changes".
21:- v3 2024-10-23, 34 pp: "improved exposition, more details to the proof added".
22:- v4 2025-02-17, 67 pp: "significantly improved version: investigation of solutions to the string equation is added" — paper doubles; S5 correspondence machinery added, presumably to repair/rigorize the transport step from Weyl pairs to spectral series.
23:- v5 2026-01-19, 78 pp: "extended introduction, more comments and references added, **calculations at the last stage of the proof are simplified**, some typos fixed".
24:- Read: 25→78 pp with the contradiction-stage calculation reworked twice (v4, v5). v5 thanks "anonymous referees" (who pointed out Schwarz's papers) ⇒ under journal review; referee round(s) happened but no acceptance signal. Author also thanks Makar-Limanov, Valqui (of GGV), Junhu Guo.
