16:## 1. Precise statement of Conjecture E, with all objects defined
17:
18:Ambient ring `R = C[x,y]`; `[f,g] = f_x g_y − f_y g_x`. For a direction `w=(u,1)`,
19:`f = Σ_j f_j^w` is the w-homogeneous decomposition (`f_j^w` = span of `x^i y^k` with `ui+k=j`);
20:`w-deg` = top such `j`. `N^0(f)` = convex hull of `supp(f) ∪ {(0,0)}`.
21:`T_{m,n} = {(x,y): 0 ≤ y ≤ n, 0 ≤ x ≤ m+n−y}` (trapezoid).
22:`𝕋` = Tschirnhausen polynomials `α(z) = z^k + e_{k−2}z^{k−2} + ... + e_0` (monic, no `z^{k−1}`).
23:`ℰ(f) = {E : f = α(E), α ∈ 𝕋}`; `f` is **principal** iff `ℰ(f) = {f}`.
24:`[r]_+ = max(0,r)`.
25:
26:### Discrete parameters (eq. `uLetc1`/`uLetc2` ≈ (4.1)/(4.2))
27:
28:- `(a,b,m,n) ∈ 𝒬 = {m<n, a|m, a|n, gcd(a,b)=1, 2 ≤ a < b}` (positive integers).
29:- `δ ∈ Δ` = positive common divisors of `m/a` and `n/a`.
30:- `ε = 1/(m(n−m))`; `i ∈ ℐ = {i ∈ [0, m(n−m)] : m|i or (n−m)|(i+1)}` (exclusive by Lemma `not_both`).
31:- Case split:
32:  - if `m | i` (so `u=0`, `w=(0,1)`): `L = x+1`, `u_E = (n−m)/(δa)`, `u_F = ⌊i(n−m)ε⌋`,
33:    `R_2 = C[x^{±1}, y^{±1/m}]`, `S(τ) = (x+1)y^{n/m}`;
34:  - if `(n−m) | (i+1)` (so `u=1`, `w=(1,1)`): `L = x+y`, `u_E = m/(δa)`, `u_F = ⌊(i+1)mε⌋`,
35:    `R_2 = C[x^{±1/n}, y^{±1}]`, `S(τ) = x^{m/n}(x+y)`.
36:- `d = um+n`, `e = bd/a`, `𝔪 = d+e−u−2`, `v_E = d/(δa)`, `r = gcd(m,n)`,
37:  `a_i = ⌊(i+1)mε⌋`, `b_i = a_i + ⌊i(n−m)ε⌋`.
38:- `v_F` (three cases):
39:  - `u_F + (un−um+m)(a−1)/a − 1` if `i > m(n−m)(a−1)/a`;
40:  - `u·a_i + b_i − 1` if `i ≤ m(n−m)(a−1)/a` and `aδ⌊i(n−m)ε⌋/(n−m) = aδ⌊(i+1)mε⌋/m ∈ Z`;
41:  - `u·a_i + b_i` otherwise.
42:
43:### Formal (tilde) layer
44:
45:`R_1 = C[Γ̃_0..Γ̃_{v_E−1}, x̃_0..x̃_{v_F}, c̃_1, c̃_2, ...]`, and in `R_1[τ]`:
