6:Project Euclid surface, ScienceDirect surface, local refs/ PDFs). Mission: determine whether Theorem A
7:(MATHIEU.md §5.1: char 0, w ≥ 1 integer, A, C ∈ F[y], A·C′ − w·A′·C = c ≠ 0 ⟹ deg A ≤ 1) or a
8:trivially-equivalent statement is already published. Criterion used, per mission: a published statement
