where \(u_+,v_+\) are the top ordinary homogeneous parts.  Then, for every
target coordinate \(h(U,V)\),

\[
 \deg h(P\circ L,Q\circ L)=D_L\deg_{r,s}h.
\tag{2.3}
\]

If \(K=(h_1,h_2)\) is any target automorphism, then

