    \frac{v_{1,1}(P)}{v_{1,1}(Q)}=\frac{v_{1,0}(P)}{v_{1,0}(Q)}=\frac{m}{n},\qquad v_{1,-1}(\operatorname{en}_{1,0}(P))<0.
