 X_y=\bigoplus_{q=1}^{30}t^{r_q}k[[u]],\qquad u=t^6.
\]

The deterministic stream order and allowed residues are

| order | family | residues \(\rho\) |
|---:|---|---|
| 1--6 | `tf1` | \(0,1,2,3,4,5\) |
| 7--12 | `tf2` | \(0,1,2,3,4,5\) |
